# Schema migrations and demo seeds — never served over HTTP.
#
# Everything in here is either a .sql migration (already denied at the app root)
# or a .php script that talks to the database with its own mysqli handle. They
# are run by hand from a terminal:
#
#     php database/phase5c_demo_seed.php --database=marlehoteldb_demo_test
#
# Until 2026-10-14 that was only a convention: a plain GET of
# /MarleHotel/database/phase5c_demo_seed.php executed the seed for anyone who
# asked and echoed its progress ("Demo seed already complete: 225 stays."). The
# scripts now refuse to run outside the CLI as well (PHP_SAPI guard) — this file
# is the same rule enforced at the door, so a future script that forgets the
# guard still cannot be reached by a web request.
#
# Nothing in the app loads anything from this directory over HTTP; the seed
# scripts are included by each other on the filesystem, which .htaccess does
# not touch.

Require all denied

php_flag engine off
RemoveHandler .php .phtml .php3 .php4 .php5 .php7 .php8 .pl .py .cgi .sh
<FilesMatch "\.(php|phtml|php[0-9]|pl|py|cgi|sh)$">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>
Options -Indexes
